  "body": [
    "I built this kit for a friend two months ago. Then entirely forgot about making this video until now.",
    "Overall, it is a nice kit to own in your collection, either gunpla or figure.",
    "Comparing to gunpla model kits, it does lack what we call \"mechanics\" or \"gimmicks\" as it is straight up a figure model kit. Yet it has similar details to kits like Barbatos or RG with the moving pieces on body and the equipments.",
    "Comparing to figures, it is pretty good deal with a lot of toys to play with. A blueprint, a background, a multi-purpose base which can store every spare parts including hands, a pet transforming into backpack or weapon, an amazing coat, an arsenal of guns and effects.",
    "Build experience, nothing to say as everything is straight up 10/10 to me without using the knife, at all. I didn't have troubles with the legs as the other reviewers said.",
    "My only complaint is the water slides. They are a bit... bland? If you don't often do water slides or sticker, then this could be a plus lol"
  ],
